see that it's drawn both angles I've got. So let's&nbsp;
make these angles even more separate, you can see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:22.620
if the angle is really small the sort of pairing&nbsp;
angle is further away. I mean I don't want to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:22.620 --> 00:08:26.220
drop the spoiler in here but maybe Brady you have an&nbsp;
instinct about how to make that angle bigger? Like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:31.500
what what would you want to be true about these&nbsp;
