what you said about touching, uh technical maths&nbsp;
word, tangent, that where that line is a tangent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:59.580
to the circle is going to be where the top two&nbsp;
versions of the angle coincide and we've got the&nbsp;&nbsp;

